## Analysis Report: `no-sub-about-gallery` Section

### 1. HTML STRUCTURE

**File:** `views/pages/about/index.php` (Lines 188-202)

```html
<section class="no-sub-about-section no-sub-about-gallery" data-scene="gallery" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="no-sub-about-gallery__sticky">
        <div class="no-sub-about-gallery__content">
            <h2 class="no-sub-about-gallery__headline f-display-1 is-block-reveal">
                <span class="mask-target">우리는 당신의 브랜드 개발 디자인<br>여정을 리드한다.</span>
            </h2>
            <p class="no-sub-about-gallery__sub f-body-1 --regular is-block-reveal">
                <span class="mask-target">똑같은 사이트가 아닌, 돋보이는 사이트를 위한다.</span>
            </p>
        </div>
        <div class="no-sub-about-gallery__canvas-wrap">
            <canvas id="about-gallery-canvas" aria-hidden="true"></canvas>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
```

**Key Elements:**
- Root container with BEM naming: `.no-sub-about-gallery`
- `data-scene="gallery"` for Theatre.js integration and scroll tracking
- Sticky positioning for viewport-fixed layout
- Two main children: text content overlay (`__content`) and canvas wrapper (`__canvas-wrap`)
- Canvas element `#about-gallery-canvas` for WebGL rendering
- Text elements use `.is-block-reveal` for animated text reveal on scroll
- `aria-hidden="true"` for the section (managed by Theatre.js)

---

### 2. SCSS STYLES

**File:** `resource/scss/pages/_sub.scss` (Lines 509-557)

```scss
.no-sub-about-gallery {
  width: 100%;
  min-height: 200svh;

  &__sticky {
    position: sticky;
    top: 0;
