**Error 1: Second text was `<p class="__sub">` but user wanted `<h2 class="__headline">`**
- User manually changed HTML: both texts are now `<h2 class="no-sub-about-proof__headline f-display-1 is-block-reveal">`
- Fix: Updated selectors from class-based (`.__sub`) to DOM position-based (`:first-child`, `:last-child`)
- Removed orphaned `__sub` SCSS rule

**Error 2: Both texts appearing simultaneously on first attempt**
- User reported: "지금은 동시에 보여지면서 스토리텔링이 이상해지고 있ㅇ"
