- Fix: `PROOF_STAGE_SPLIT = 0.42`, `PROOF_SUB_SHOW = 0.68` (26% = 52svh gap), `enterDelayMs = 900`, `sHide = !sShow && progress < PROOF_SUB_SHOW - 0.06`

**Error 4 (ONGOING): User not satisfied with JS-threshold approach**
- User requested CSS sticky/fixed approach instead
- Not yet implemented — this is the PENDING task

5. Problem Solving:

**Solved:**
- Gallery section: text centered, gallery/text synchronized reveal, 100svh hold buffer added
- Proof section: camera zoom-in removed, velocity-based rotation boost added, 100svh hold buffer
- HTML structure for two sequential headlines in proof section
- Selector differentiation using `:first-child`/`:last-child` when both elements share the same class
- Timer-based delay to ensure CSS transition of first text completes before second appears

**Ongoing:**
- Proof section sequential text reveal reliability — user wants CSS sticky/fixed approach instead of JS scroll progress thresholds
- The `no-sub-about-journey-surface` parent confirmed to have no `overflow: hidden` — CSS sticky inside it should work

6. All user messages:
